    "id": 364,
    "repository_id": 12,
    "tag_name": "1.0.0",
    "name": "v1.0.0",
    "body": "# Release Notes 🚀 \r\n\r\nJumping from `v0.2` to `v1.0` 😃 as we added a bunch of features, fixed bugs, and made things more stable. \r\n\r\n## What's New\r\n- HUD Overlay UX improvements.\r\n- Resizable Preview-Timeline Layout.\r\n- Trim segments of the video just like drag areas.\r\n- Option to enable/disable motion-blur.\r\n- Customize border radius for the recording.\r\n- Customize video padding against wallpaper. \r\n- Exports in multiple aspect ratios (1:1, 16:9, 9:16, 4:5, 4:3)  \r\n- Annotations (text, arrows, images).\r\n- Draggable timeline playhead.\r\n- Shortcuts for better UX.\r\n- Export Resolution options. \r\n- Fixed bad export fps drop (please reinstall)\r\n\r\n## Bugs fixed\r\n- Exported video aspect ratio not matching 16:9.\r\n- Missing zoom level on timeline appearing a 6x.\r\n- Fixing the border radius issue found in macOS 26.\r\n- Wallpaper not showing up in export at times.\r\n\r\nAs much as I would like to implement auto-updates from the app using electron-updater, it is not reliable and worth the effort because the app is unsigned. \r\n\r\nEnjoy the features! Thank you for the feedback and interest!\r\n",
