    "body": "## Release Notes  \r\n### v0.0.0\r\n\r\nBeta release of OpenScreen. May contain bugs, but includes the core tools needed to create smooth and clean product demos.\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n- Record your whole screen or individual apps.\r\n- Add manual zooms with customizable depth levels.\r\n- Adjust zoom duration, position, and timing exactly how you want.\r\n- Crop recordings to hide anything you do not want in the frame.\r\n- Choose wallpapers, solid colors, or gradients for your background.\r\n- Known slow exports. Working on making it faster for future versions!\r\n",
